{"id":4813,"name":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria Season 2","slug":"tsue_to_tsurugi_no_wistoria_season_2","synopsis":"The second season of *Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria*.\n\nWill, a washout student at a magical academy who is unable to use magic, is aiming to join the top tier of mages, the Magia Vander, to fulfill a promise to his childhood friend, Elfaria. Wielding a sword instead of a wand, his abilities are slowly recognized within the academy. During the all-student praxis dungeon training he undertakes with Lihanna and the other top students of his year, they are ambushed by a mysterious mage. Though they barely manage to survive the attack together, they go on to face the exit exam. Can Will reach the girl waiting for him in the tower?\n\n(Source: Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2 English Site)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2026,"createdAt":"2026-04-15 19:29:15","updatedAt":"2026-04-15 19:29:15","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":182300},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18889},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":49241},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":12861},{"site":"MAL","externalId":59983},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":33629}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":13281,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/rVtCFS14oUllhESOK4YjUvxZDRF9KpSnAXdozkPM.avif"},{"id":13282,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/4pirh2E0pFs3KPaxcegJNIttQ4AaEzaj6Bi8NzYZ.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":36,"name":"Bandai Namco Pictures","slug":"bandai_namco_pictures"},{"id":42,"name":"Actas","slug":"actas"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":698,"name":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","slug":"tsue_to_tsurugi_no_wistoria"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":14333,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":14242,"title":"BELIEVERS","titleNative":"BELIEVERS"},"animethemeentries":[{"id":16764,"version":1,"episodes":"1-","nsfw":